 "level_notes": {
  "1": "VDM-SL is ISO/IEC 13817-1:1996 (paywalled). The Overture community's VDM-10 Language Manual (free PDF) is the working definition of VDM-SL, VDM++ and VDM-RT as implemented by Overture/VDMJ; section links use #page=N via jsDelivr.",
  "0": "Overture (Eclipse-based, Java) and VDMJ (Nick Battle's command-line interpreter/type checker, which Overture's core derives from) are the main open implementations; the VDM VSCode extension uses VDMJ."
 },
